                        "language": "english",
                        "review": ">Experience the fun with vickinachi\n\nI tried my best but I can't - there is only one level in this game, you can see it all in the game's trailer, if you look closer at 0.08 and at 1.06 of the trailer you can see that he enters the same door. There is nothing going on in the game, you can open some chests, pick up some gold and potions and sleep with 2 girls for 10 gold. And that's it.\n\nUpd: there is an actual level 2 thank to this guy\nhttp://steamcommunity.com/app/652550/discussions/0/1458455461474506863/\n\nFor sure \n>You are going to experience the fun mischief with our Vickinachi, there are many levels and design\n\nBy the way, the window size is locked at 560x420 lol.\n\nThere are achievements but I have no idea how to unlock them.\n\nAnd look at this lol\nhttp://store.steampowered.com/curators/curatorsreviewing/?appid=652550",
